  "description": "The Stereo 160 SL 27.5's four pivot frame is a prime example of the current state of the art in frame design and construction. Triple butted 7005 High Performance Aluminium tubes, put through a hydroforming process to reduce weight and add strength, combine with Boost 148x12 rear axle and Trail Motion Rocker linkage to provide a rigid frame structure that's still remarkably light for its travel class. Our Efficient Trail Control system ensures the best possible suspension performance, regardless of frame size. And the standard-setting lively steering and stable downhill performance is thanks to the carefully honed Agile Trail Geometry, which we've spent years refining. It's your guarantee of the ride of your life.",
